    <string name="game_help_rules">Use arrows, keyboard, D-pad, swipe, or tap the board to move one cell.\nThe red Kryvavitsa hunts the Monster. Purple lesser Kryvavitsas wander randomly.\nPush gray walls into free cells to clear a path. The thick border blocks leaving the board.\nScore: -10 per move, +10 for pushing a wall, +50 for crushing a purple enemy, +1000 for reaching the exit.\nIf any enemy reaches the same or neighboring cell, the game ends.</string>
